1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,268
Narrow the gap down towards one wavelength.

2
00:00:03,268 --> 00:00:07,682
Now the waves fan out into the shadow, almost in circles.

3
00:00:07,682 --> 00:00:09,661
The gap acts like a new source.

4
00:00:09,661 --> 00:00:17,669
That is Huygens' principle at work: with only a few points across the gap sending out wavelets, there is nothing to keep the front flat.

